  "design_notes_md": "# \ud83c\udfa8 Design Notes \u2014 Bakken &amp; B\u00e6ck is a design and technology studio. We build digital products, \n\n> **URL:** https://bakkenbaeck.com/  \n> **Style:** minimal luxury  \n> **Premium Score:** 58/100 (\ud83d\udc4d Above Average)\n\n## Quick Profile\n\n| Trait | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Mood | calm sophistication |\n| Era | contemporary |\n| Contrast | high-contrast |\n| Whitespace | generous |\n| Complexity | complex |\n| Density | moderate-sparse (29/100) |\n| Whitespace Ratio | 0.79 |\n\n## Typography & Colour\n\n- **Typography prominence:** balanced\n- **Typography pattern:** large-bold-headings\n- **Colour contrast:** high-contrast\n\n## Layout & Rhythm\n\n- **Hero type:** large-centered\n- **Section count:** 15\n- **Spacing rhythm:** dramatic-variation\n- **Content width:** mixed-widths\n- **Vertical rhythm:** generous-breathing\n\n**Section flow:** `content \u2192 video-section \u2192 content \u2192 cta \u2192 content \u2192 footer \u2192 video-section \u2192 content`\n\n> Page flow: content \u2192 video-section \u2192 content \u2192 cta \u2192 content \u2192 footer \u2192 video-section \u2192 content. Presenting core content, featuring video content for engagement, presenting core content, culminating in a clear call-to-action, presenting core content, closing with navigation and contact information, featuring video content for engagement, presenting core content.\n\n### Captured Sections\n\n- `section-01.png` \u2014 *section-01* (1440\u00d7226)\n- `gallery.png` \u2014 *gallery* (1440\u00d71605)\n- `section-03.png` \u2014 *section-03* (1440\u00d7390)\n- `gallery-2.png` \u2014 *gallery* (1440\u00d7300)\n- `section-05.png` \u2014 *section-05* (1440\u00d7112)\n- `gallery-3.png` \u2014 *gallery* (1408\u00d788)\n- `footer.png` \u2014 *footer* (1440\u00d7390)\n- `section-09.png` \u2014 *section-09* (1440\u00d73494)\n- `section-10.png` \u2014 *section-10* (464\u00d7687)\n- `section-11.png` \u2014 *section-11* (464\u00d7687)\n- `section-12.png` \u2014 *section-12* (464\u00d7687)\n- `section-13.png` \u2014 *section-13* (464\u00d7687)\n- `section-14.png` \u2014 *section-14* (464\u00d7687)\n- `section-15.png` \u2014 *section-15* (464\u00d7687)\n\n## Navigation\n\n- **Pattern (basic):** standard\n- **Style:** transparent-static\n- **Behaviour:** static\n- **Fixed:** no\n- **Backdrop blur:** no\n- **Shadow:** no\n- **Links:** 13\n- **Logo:** yes\n\n## Animation & Motion\n\n- **Approach:** rich multi-layered motion design\n- **Intensity:** dramatic\n- **Transition style:** smooth-elegant\n- **Libraries:** Animate.css\n- **Techniques:** scroll-reveal, css-keyframe-animations, custom-cursor, marquee-ticker\n\n### Timing Pattern: **stagger**\n\n- Animated elements: 60\n- Elements with delay: 6\n- Stagger #1: 6 elements, ~200.0ms step\n\n## \u26a1 Animation Tech Stack\n\n- **Framework renderer:** `Next.js`\n- **Stack complexity:** css-only\n\n## \ud83d\udcdc Scroll Behavior\n\n- **Frames captured:** 19\n- **Page height:** 3,885px\n- **Viewport height:** 900px\n- **Scroll GIF size:** 368.4 KB\n- **Preview:** `motion/scroll/page-scroll-preview.gif`\n\n### High-Animation Zones\n\n- `py-10` (0px \u2013 226px)\n- `py-10` (226px \u2013 1831px)\n- `py-10` (1831px \u2013 2221px)\n- `w-full` (2221px \u2013 2521px)\n- `py-10` (2521px \u2013 2633px)\n- `flex` (2633px \u2013 2721px)\n- `skip-nav` (3111px \u2013 6605px)\n- `group` (6605px \u2013 7292px)\n- `group` (7292px \u2013 7979px)\n- `group` (7979px \u2013 8666px)\n- `group` (8666px \u2013 9353px)\n\n## \ud83c\udfac Motion Capture\n\n- **Animation groups detected:** 3\n- **Techniques:** group-hover:animate-pause, stagger-1, marquee-2\n- **Types:** keyframe, entrance\n\n### Animation Groups\n\n- \u2605 **entrance-stagger-1** \u2014 entrance / `stagger-1` (trigger: page-load)\n  - Selectors: `figure.group/figure relative aspect-3/4 overflow-hidden rounded-sm duration-500 delay-[200ms] opacity-100, figure.group/figure relative aspect-3/4 overflow-hidden rounded-sm duration-500 delay-[400ms] opacity-100`\n- \u25cf **keyframe-marquee-2** \u2014 keyframe / `marquee-2` (trigger: page-load)\n  - Selectors: `ul`\n- \u25cf **class-group-hover:animate-pause** \u2014 entrance / `group-hover:animate-pause` (trigger: class-toggle)\n  - Selectors: `[class*='group-hover:animate-pause']`\n\n## \ud83d\uddb1 Interaction Capture\n\n- **Interactive elements detected:** 5\n- **Element types:** image, nav-link\n- **Interaction types:** hover\n\n### Targets\n\n- \u25cf **nav-link-hover** \u2014 Navigation link hover (13 links) (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-1** \u2014 Image hover in section 1 (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-3** \u2014 Image hover in section 3 (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-8** \u2014 Image hover in section 8 (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-13** \u2014 Image hover in section 13 (hover)\n\n## Imagery\n\n- **Primary approach:** product-focused with high-quality renders\n- **Hero:** video-background\n- **Background:** video-background\n- **Icons:** font-awesome\n- **Density:** image-heavy\n- **Effects:** blur-backdrop, noise-texture\n\n## \ud83d\uddbc Media Intelligence\n\n- **Hero media:** video\n- **Media density:** media-heavy\n- **Images detected:** 25\n- **Videos detected:** 5\n- **SVGs detected:** 30\n- **Icon system:** monochrome-filled\n- **Icon library:** Font Awesome\n\n### Image Roles\n\n- `icon`: 22\n- `content`: 3\n\n### Video Usage\n\n- **hero-video** (loop, muted)\n- **content-video** (loop, muted)\n- **content-video** (loop, muted)\n- **content-video** (loop, muted)\n- **content-video** (loop, muted)\n\n## Premium Patterns\n\n- full-width-sections\n- glassmorphism\n- custom-cursor\n- marquee-text\n- generous-whitespace\n**Special effects:** custom-cursor\n\n**CTA style:** standard\n**Footer style:** mega-footer\n\n## Key Takeaways\n\n1. Study the minimal luxury aesthetic approach and how it creates cohesion\n2. Replicate the rich multi-layered motion design motion strategy\n3. Apply the product-focused with high-quality renders approach to visual content\n4. Adopt the large-bold-headings typography approach\n\n---\n\n*Generated by UX Analyzer \u2014 Design Intelligence Engine*",
